init-a  (acme)  ~/init-a  1 now, 1 blocked, 2 next
  now      alpha   feat/alpha  3d   Finish alpha
  blocked  gamma   none        1d   Wait for gamma owner
  next     beta    feat/beta   13d  Start beta
  next     nonext              1mo  
  ! ~/init-a/working-on/broken.md: no frontmatter: file must start with ---
  ! ~/init-a/working-on/nonext.md: open card without next action
  ! ~/init-a/working-on/roadmap.yaml: stage joins exit "a wave is grouped" met "soon" is not YYYY-MM-DD
  ! ~/init-a/working-on/roadmap.yaml: stage id "joins" is used twice
  ! ~/init-a/working-on/roadmap.yaml: stage joins gates on decision 0099, which does not exist
  ! ~/init-a/working-on/beta.md: stage "no-such-stage" is not on the roadmap

init-b  (personal)  ~/work/init-b  0 now, 0 blocked, 1 next
  next  only-next  main  today  Do the thing
